+	// m52xq r64: the full 9248x6936 frame of the S5KGW3 is a raw 4-cell (Tetracell) array: 2x2 blocks of one colour
+	// (Gr Gr R R / Gr Gr R R / B B Gb Gb / B B Gb Gb). Samsung re-mosaics it in closed software; here every pixel moves to
